{"name":"Infinity Pool","hex":"#94d4e4","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"infinity pool","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Synonym of infinity-edge pool."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/infinity_pool"}],"entries":[{"title":"Infinity pool","blocks":[{"text":"An infinity pool is a reflecting pool or swimming pool where the water flows over one or more edges, producing a visual effect of water with no boundary. Such pools are often designed so that the edge appears to merge with a larger body of water such as the ocean, or with the sky, and may overlook locations such as natural landscapes and cityscapes. They are often seen at hotels, resorts, estates, and in other luxurious places."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/SkyPark_Infinity_Pool_%28view_from_deckchair%29.jpg/330px-SkyPark_Infinity_Pool_%28view_from_deckchair%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Infinity_pool"},{"title":"Infinity Pool (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Infinity Pool is a 2023 science fiction horror film written and directed by Brandon Cronenberg. The film stars Alexander Skarsgård, Mia Goth, and Cleopatra Coleman. Set in the fictional country of Li Tolqa, it follows struggling novelist James Foster (Skarsgård) and his wife Em (Coleman), a couple on vacation at a seaside resort who, after meeting another couple and having dinner with them, discover the country's dark culture."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/eb/Infinity_Pool_poster2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Infinity_Pool_(film)"},{"title":"Infinity","blocks":[{"text":"Infinity is something which is boundless, limitless, or endless. It is denoted by ∞, called the infinity symbol."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/SierpinskiTriangle.svg/330px-SierpinskiTriangle.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Infinity"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/SkyPark_Infinity_Pool_%28view_from_deckchair%29.jpg/500px-SkyPark_Infinity_Pool_%28view_from_deckchair%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/SkyPark_Infinity_Pool_%28view_from_deckchair%29.jpg/1280px-SkyPark_Infinity_Pool_%28view_from_deckchair%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/SkyPark_Infinity_Pool_%28view_from_deckchair%29.jpg/500px-SkyPark_Infinity_Pool_%28view_from_deckchair%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASkyPark_Infinity_Pool_(view_from_deckchair).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/SkyPark_Infinity_Pool_%28view_from_pool_near_the_edge%29.jpg/500px-SkyPark_Infinity_Pool_%28view_from_pool_near_the_edge%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/SkyPark_Infinity_Pool_%28view_from_pool_near_the_edge%29.jpg/1280px-SkyPark_Infinity_Pool_%28view_from_pool_near_the_edge%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/SkyPark_Infinity_Pool_%28view_from_pool_near_the_edge%29.jpg/500px-SkyPark_Infinity_Pool_%28view_from_pool_near_the_edge%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASkyPark_Infinity_Pool_(view_from_pool_near_the_edge).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Rosewood_Hong_Kong_Level_6_Sw